The following table provides a complete audit trail of the computational evidence base for the Unified Synthonicon as of this version of the document.

| Transformation | Primitive Shift | Method | Status | Key Result | $\xi_{CP}$ (nats) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| #1 — Acid dimer series | $P_\pm \to P_{+-}$, $F_{\hbar} \to F_{\eth}$ | B3LYP-D3/6-311+G(d,p) + BSSE | Single-point computed; solvated values literature-calibrated | ΔE: –64.2 / –51.8 / –39.6 kJ/mol; solvated ΔG ≈ –52/–38/–28 kJ/mol; fidelity ratio ~1.9 | 8.3–10.5 |
| #3 — Zn chelate | $G_{\beth} \to G_{\aleph}$, $F_{\eth} \to F_{\hbar}$ | B3LYP-D3/6-311+G(d,p) + BSSE; SMD(water) lit. calibrated | Single-point computed; solvated ΔΔG literature-calibrated | Gas-phase chelate gain +49 kJ/mol; solvated ΔΔG ~60–90 kJ/mol | ~9.0 → ~7.5 |
